{
    "title": "Temple Run",
    "description": "Experience the thrill of Temple Run, now available on Android! \r\n\r\nJoin the global phenomenon and outpace your friends' top scores!\r\n\r\nEmbark on a heart-pounding adventure as you flee with the stolen idol from the clutches of sinister Demon Monkeys. Sharpen your reflexes in a high-stakes sprint down the corridors of ancient temples and precarious cliff edges. Navigate with intuitive swipes: leap over gaps, dodge obstacles, and slide under hazards. \r\n\r\nAccumulate coins to acquire power-ups, unlock diverse characters, and push your limits to see the distance you can cover!\r\n\r\n\"In every treasure hunting adventure movie there\u2019s one scene in which the plucky hero finally gets his hands on the treasure but then has to navigate a maze of booby traps in order to get out alive. Temple Run is this scene and nothing else. And it\u2019s amazing.\" - SlideToPlay.com\r\n\r\n\r\nREVIEWS\r\n\r\n\u2605 \"Most thrilling and fun running game in a while, possibly ever.\" - TheAppera.com\r\n\r\n\u2605 \"A fast and frenzied experience.\" - IGN.com\r\n\r\n\u2605 \"Very addicting\u2026 definitely a very different running game.\" - Appolicious.com\r\n\r\n\u2605 Voted by TouchArcade Forums as Game of the Week\r\n\r\n\u2605 One of TouchArcade's Best Games of the Month\r\n\r\n\u2605 Over 50 MILLION players worldwide!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Experience the thrill of Temple Run, now available on Android! <br><br>Join the global phenomenon and outpace your friends&#39; top scores!<br><br>Embark on a heart-pounding adventure as you flee with the stolen idol from the clutches of sinister Demon Monkeys. Sharpen your reflexes in a high-stakes sprint down the corridors of ancient temples and precarious cliff edges. Navigate with intuitive swipes: leap over gaps, dodge obstacles, and slide under hazards. <br><br>Accumulate coins to acquire power-ups, unlock diverse characters, and push your limits to see the distance you can cover!<br><br>&quot;In every treasure hunting adventure movie there\u2019s one scene in which the plucky hero finally gets his hands on the treasure but then has to navigate a maze of booby traps in order to get out alive. Temple Run is this scene and nothing else. And it\u2019s amazing.&quot; - SlideToPlay.com<br><br><br>REVIEWS<br><br>\u2605 &quot;Most thrilling and fun running game in a while, possibly ever.&quot; - TheAppera.com<br><br>\u2605 &quot;A fast and frenzied experience.&quot; - IGN.com<br><br>\u2605 &quot;Very addicting\u2026 definitely a very different running game.&quot; - Appolicious.com<br><br>\u2605 Voted by TouchArcade Forums as Game of the Week<br><br>\u2605 One of TouchArcade&#39;s Best Games of the Month<br><br>\u2605 Over 50 MILLION players worldwide!",
